#: ../../guide-wasm-plugin.md:1
msgid "Writing a WASM Plugin"
msgstr "Writing a WASM Plugin"

#: ../../guide-wasm-plugin.md:3
msgid "This guide walks through building a WASM plugin for Language Check using Go and TinyGo. The same principles apply to any language with an [Extism PDK](https://extism.org/docs/write-a-plugin/)."
msgstr "This guide walks through building a WASM plugin for Language Check using Go and TinyGo. The same principles apply to any language with an [Extism PDK](https://extism.org/docs/write-a-plugin/)."

#: ../../guide-wasm-plugin.md:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Overview"

#: ../../guide-wasm-plugin.md:7
msgid "Language Check loads WASM plugins via [Extism](https://extism.org/). Each plugin exports a `check` function that receives prose text and returns diagnostics. Plugins run in a sandboxed WebAssembly environment — they cannot access the filesystem, network, or host memory."
msgstr "Language Check loads WASM plugins via [Extism](https://extism.org/). Each plugin exports a `check` function that receives prose text and returns diagnostics. Plugins run in a sandboxed WebAssembly environment — they cannot access the filesystem, network, or host memory."

