#: ../../guide-wasm-plugin.md:238
msgid "**JSON parse failures**: If your output isn't valid JSON, the host silently returns empty diagnostics. Test your JSON serialization in unit tests."
msgstr "**JSON parse failures**: If your output isn't valid JSON, the host silently returns empty diagnostics. Test your JSON serialization in unit tests."

#: ../../guide-wasm-plugin.md:239
msgid "**Byte offsets**: Offsets must be valid UTF-8 byte positions in the input text. Off-by-one errors here cause garbled diagnostic ranges."
msgstr "**Byte offsets**: Offsets must be valid UTF-8 byte positions in the input text. Off-by-one errors here cause garbled diagnostic ranges."

#: ../../guide-wasm-plugin.md:240
msgid "**Empty output**: Return `[]` (empty JSON array), not an empty string, when there are no issues."
